lets/Toilet%20Suites/Toilet%20Suites%20-%20Tech%20Pages/Manhattan-Suite-Instructions-Feb23-R2.pdf","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200}],"summary":"","variants":{"finishes":[{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Manhattan-Rimless-Suite_man001","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-man001","label":"Gloss White"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Manhattan-Rimless-Suite---Matte-White_MAN001-MW","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-man001-mw","label":"Matte White"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div>Designed in Australia, Manhattan boasts crisp contemporary design aesthetics making it a perfect fit for a vast range of bathroom styles. Our superior Rimless technology features a full 360° spiral rapid flushing waterway, which has been rigorously refined to produce a powerful yet water efficient (WELS 4 Star Rating) Flush.<br/><br/>Our one-touch quick release seat coupled with the removal of the rim eliminates areas for dirt and grime to build up so cleaning is a breeze. All Studio Bagno toilets come standard with our CleanMax anti0bacterial self cleaning glaze technology, preventing surface dirt accumulation and bacteria breeding, at no extra cost!<div>Available and in stock in <b>Matte White</b>*<br/><br/>Notes:<br/>Set out 90-220 mm (S-Trap)<br/>Suitable for S-Trap or P-Trap Installation<br/>Cleanmax nanotech anti-bacterial surface technology.<br/>Available as Back or Bottom Inlet.</div><div>When purchased, is supplied with a white button and white hinge covers to suit the matte white suite.</div><div>*Normal stock outages in Matte White may apply however wait time won't be long.</div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
